## Secrets rotation cadence

| Secret | Normal cadence | Emergency rotation trigger | Procedure |
|---|---|---|---|
| DB password (`DATABASE_URL`) | Quarterly (Jan/Apr/Jul/Oct) | Suspected breach or personnel change | `docker secret rm` → update env file → `docker compose restart app db` → verify `/api/ready` |
| B2 application key | Yearly + on breach | Breach, key exposure in logs | B2 console → delete key → create new → update `RCLONE_B2_APPLICATION_KEY` → test backup run |
| Sentry DSN | Yearly | Sentry project delete/recreate | Update `SENTRY_DSN` → restart app → verify Sentry event receipt |
| GitHub PAT (deploy) | Every 6 months | GH personnel change | GH Settings → generate new → update GH Secrets `GH_PAT_DEPLOY` |
| iron-session secret (`SESSION_SECRET`) | On breach only | Session token compromise suspected | Update env → `docker compose restart app` → all active sessions invalidated (users re-login) |
| TLS certificate | Auto-renewed by Caddy | N/A | Caddy handles Let's Encrypt auto-renewal (60-day cert, renewed at 30 days) |

**Rotation audit log:** każda rotacja musi być odnotowana w `artifacts/audit-trail/secrets-rotation.log` (format: `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS | SECRET_TYPE | ROTATED_BY | REASON`).

