## Known security limitations (v1)

| Limitation | Impact | Mitigation | Planned fix |
|---|---|---|---|
| TOTP optional (feature flag `TOTP_REQUIRED=false` default) | 2FA not enforced for all sessions | Strong password (zxcvbn ≥3) + session expiry 8h | Enable `TOTP_REQUIRED=true` before external audit |
| No Cloudflare proxy | VPS IP exposed, DDoS only mitigated by Caddy rate limit | Caddy rate_limit 1000r/m + Hono endpoint limits | v2 if traffic grows |
| Manual pentest not performed | Potential unknown vulnerabilities | OWASP ZAP automated DAST in CI (weekly + push) | v2 if insurance/compliance requirement |
| Single VPS (no HA) | Downtime during maintenance/failure | B2 backup + restore drill monthly | v2 if SLA requirement tightens |

